WEBVTT

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:05.330
I wonder what it will be?

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.290
This week, it's this!

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.360
Today's fortune is average.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.520
You may find something that you lost?

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.840
Hi, this is Carly!  If you need 
to reach me, leave a message.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.290
Carly, what happened at Satellite?

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:34.250
Hurry up and bring me an 
article or you're fired!

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:43.390
Thanks for everything.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:45.680
I'm leaving.

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:47.940
Then I'm also going to Satellite!

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:54.430
Stop digging deeper into this situation.

00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:59.050
This is the destiny of the 
Signers.  It's not for you.

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:03.090
But I want to learn the truth!

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:08.300
I promise that I'll tell you everything 
when it's over.  For now, stay out of it.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.470
Jack!

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.930
I want you to be safe.

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:17.690
Jack…

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:24.730
Why did you leave, Jack?

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:42.670
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:47.770
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:52.680
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:57.450
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:02.810
No matter how bad today is

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:07.800
There’s still the faintest light

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:13.200
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:17.260
Is light it myself

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:22.270
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:27.240
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:33.540
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:37.520
Today will never exist again

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:43.420
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:13.100
Infiltrate!  Arcadia Movement
It’s My Turn!

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:30.140
You idiot!  Why did you have to leave?

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.910
Give me back the meal money I lent you!

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:34.410
I let you drink the tea that I was 
saving for a special occasion!

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:37.820
Though it was embarrassing, I sent 
out your men's clothing for cleaning!

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.570
Give me everything back, Jack Atlas!

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:44.530
Give me back my heart…

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:47.990
I won't stop my investigation.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:52.970
Because if I do, I'll lose 
my connection with Jack.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:07.020
Why didn't you finish off Yusei?

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:09.180
There's no need to be impatient.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:12.290
Besides, everyone on our 
side haven't gathered yet.

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:15.820
Furthermore, I want him 
to taste a living hell.

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:22.150
With the power of the Earthbound Immortal, 
I learned that he's clearly scared.

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:30.280
He's afraid of my power.

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:36.190
The most painful thing for a duelist is 
being afraid of the opponent's power.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:40.920
After he experiences that, we 
can defeat him anytime we want.

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.240
Yusei!

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:51.580
Are you healthy now?

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:54.710
Yeah.  Are you also okay?

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.840
We only had a slight fever.

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.230
How's the D-Wheel?

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:02.420
If you need any parts, 
we'll gather them for you.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:05.690
Thanks.  I'm sorry to keep troubling you.

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:07.100
Don't be like that.

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:10.160
We're friends.  You can ask us for anything.

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:12.500
Thank you.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:15.740
However, even if we fix the D-Wheel…

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:21.910
Yusei!

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:22.570
Yusei!

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:28.840
Kiryu is too powerful.

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:32.960
In my current state, I can't defeat him.

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:45.830
How does it feel to ride 
the new Wheel of Fortune?

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.720
Its construction isn't bad.

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:50.310
It has much more power 
than the previous version.

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:55.350
The damage during the 
Fortune Cup was extensive.

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:03.620
Besides, the Director wanted to 
improve Wheel of Fortune for awhile.

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:09.840
That means Godwin already knew about the 
power of the Dark Signers' D-Wheels.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:10.510
Well, whatever.

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:14.290
When this ride is finalized, 
I'm returning to Satellite.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:15.310
Right!

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:16.240
What is it?

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:20.640
I'm just happy that old Atlas is back.

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:24.500
The Atlas that travels the King's path.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:26.320
It's not the King's path.

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:29.720
There never was a King's path.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:34.410
So if there's no path, that 
means I have to create my own!

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:37.700
The true path of Jack Atlas.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.990
So what did you find?

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:47.250
Carly, it's just as you suspected.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:53.060
There were at least four Signers 
in the Fortune Cup stadium.

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:54.600
And?

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:56.870
The first is Yusei Fudo.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:59.290
Another is Jack Atlas.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:01.900
And a child named Luca.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:05.470
The final one is Aki Izayoi.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:09.010
The Dark Signers' marks were Nazca lines.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.100
What kind of pattern are these marks?

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:16.540
I don't know.  There were 
no matches in my database.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:21.540
Then I have to ask them directly.

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:24.600
I can't ask Jack or Yusei.

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:28.060
And a child won't have 
information about this.

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:30.040
That leaves Aki Izayoi.

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:32.330
Arcadia Movement.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:37.150
I knew you would arrive at this conclusion, so I 
already gathered information on Arcadia Movement.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:39.820
That's why you're an information gatherer!

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:42.510
I didn't say it would be for free.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:46.990
That's why I saved this!

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:48.450
Ta daa!

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:53.250
That's the incredibly rare Dark 
Magician Girl action figure!

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:55.060
Negotiations completed.

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:56.180
Okay!

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:04.180
Arcadia Movement has a really bad reputation.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:08.490
This is…

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:14.510
Why are we in this situation?

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:19.620
We were careless.  It was a mistake 
to trust Arcadia Movement.

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:23.450
Their goal was to kidnap us from the start.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:25.410
But why us?

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:28.100
They're most likely after Luca.

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:31.860
Does that mean they want to 
use the Signers for something?

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:37.150
I don't know.  But if they want Luca, 
that means we're the ones in danger.

00:08:37.150 --> 00:08:39.940
They'll do something bad 
to us if we stay here.

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:41.680
They're going to kill us?

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:43.680
Don't lose your cool, Grandpa.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:47.460
Let's think about how to escape from here.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:52.620
Lua…

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:55.810
Aki!

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:58.220
He's not in serious condition.

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:00.230
Why did he do this?

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:04.700
Divine wanted to know if 
he was a psychic duelist.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:09.670
Lua is a regular boy!  If he 
wants me, then let Lua go!

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:13.670
Starting today, this is your new home.

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:17.410
This is a place for people who have been 
abandoned by society and their parents.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:20.410
No one has abandoned us!

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.410
I know you understand the situation.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:26.930
People will eventually fear your abilities.

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:31.400
You're also afraid that strangers 
will find out about your power.

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:33.970
That's why you don't want 
to leave your house.

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:35.280
That's…

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:39.740
If you're left alone, you'll 
walk the same path as myself.

00:09:39.740 --> 00:09:42.270
I don't want that to happen to you.

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:43.710
Aki…

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:52.510
I knew you were here.

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:54.550
It's time for the meeting.

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:57.060
What are you planning to do with Lua?

00:09:57.060 --> 00:09:59.520
After he regains consciousness, 
I'll try to convince him.

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:04.490
If we can get Lua on our side, 
then Luca will also join us.

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:07.460
Don't hurt that child anymore.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:11.530
I know.  I no longer need to do that.

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:17.980
Ancient Fairy Dragon…

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:22.070
Help me…

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:27.950
Help me, Ancient Fairy Dragon.

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:31.430
Luca.

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:37.920
Luca, I can't help you right now.

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:42.860
However, the threat of the 
Dark Signers is approaching.

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:48.860
My servant named Regulus will come meet you.

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:53.540
Combine your powers and free me.

00:10:53.540 --> 00:11:00.280
If you do, I promise to protect 
you until the end of my life.

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:04.280
Ancient Fairy Dragon…

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:08.290
I understand.  I'll wait for that moment.

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:10.690
Lua…

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:18.760
Why can't you tell me?  What's Misty's room?

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:25.780
I already told you many times that Misty 
asked us to turn away unexpected guests.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.610
But we're acquaintances!

00:11:27.610 --> 00:11:33.610
If you really know Misty, then 
wouldn't you know how to contact her?

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:35.150
That's…

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:39.060
I can't tell her that I only 
met her once at a party.

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:42.930
Oh, you're…

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.230
Misty!

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:45.430
Long time no see.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:48.070
Misty, do you know her?

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:54.340
I came here because I wanted to ask you 
something, but she wouldn't let me in.

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:55.570
Kate.

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:58.520
I know her.

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:01.760
Come.  I'll guide you to my home.

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.790
Sit wherever you like.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.150
Okay!

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.380
It's a lovely place.

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:24.060
It's a sad place because I'm all alone.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:29.070
No matter your lifestyle, life only has 
meaning if you're with the ones you love.

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:30.030
Don't you agree?

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.660
I understand how you feel!

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:34.690
You're in love, aren't you.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.850
How do you know?

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:38.870
It's written on your face.

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:44.020
Oh yeah!  You do fortune-telling 
by looking at people's faces.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:48.150
Anyone can tell, even 
without fortune-telling.

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:49.990
Really?

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.130
Here you go.

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:54.310
Thank you.

00:12:54.310 --> 00:12:57.460
What did you want to ask me?

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.140
It's a little difficult to ask...

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:05.580
I'm investigating the Crimson Dragon 
that appeared during the Fortune Cup.

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:09.950
That led me to a duelist named Aki Izayoi.

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:13.310
You're investigating Arcadia Movement.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:17.280
Yes.  And in my documents, you showed up.

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:20.650
What it says here is true.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:25.150
Arcadia Movement killed my younger brother.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:52.270
My brother went missing after he went 
to the Daimon Area to watch a duel.

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:56.250
He was found a few days later, 
but he was completely different.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:59.670
Everyone said that it was 
the work of the witch.

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:02.590
Didn't they investigate Aki Izayoi?

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:08.070
All they did was ask Arcadia 
Movement basic questions.

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:10.940
And with that, the investigation was over.

00:14:10.940 --> 00:14:17.040
But that was the Public Maintenance 
Department's chance to crush Arcadia Movement!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:22.320
Arcadia Movement must have incriminating 
evidence on the Public Maintenance Department.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:26.280
Incriminating evidence on the Public 
Maintenance Order Department?  There is such a thing?

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:30.090
I don't know, but that's all I can think of.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:33.090
A secret that Director Godwin is afraid of...

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:34.390
I…

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:36.930
I can't forgive the witch.

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:42.640
Listen to me.  Don't go 
near Arcadia Movement.

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:48.840
Though she warned me, I'll lose my 
connection with Jack if I stop my investigation.

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:56.310
Arcadia Movement will now recruit members 
from around the world, not just Neo Domino City.

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:59.970
Aki showed everyone the 
power of psychic dueling

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:02.970
during the Fortune Cup.  We'll 
use that to our advantage.

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:06.550
Aki, you will show up at 
our meetings from now on.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:10.560
You will be the symbol of Arcadia Movement.

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:13.150
I'm going to be a billboard?

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:16.030
A billboard?  You make 
it sound disrespectable.

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:19.250
You'll be the modern-day 
Joan of Arc, an influential

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:22.250
woman who leads a stubborn 
world on the correct path.

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:26.360
Where am I?

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:29.530
I feel like I'm walking around 
the same place over and over.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.720
Divine and Aki Izayoi!

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:39.170
I have to clean over there.

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:39.960
Hey you.

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.220
Yes?

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:42.520
I've never seen you before.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:48.430
Yes.  The normal custodian has a 
fever, so I'm taking her place today.

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:51.280
I see.  Good work.

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:55.560
That scared me.

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:58.780
This is Divine's room.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:10.710
Before interviewing Aki Izayoi, I have to 
find evidence on Arcadia Movement's crimes.

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:19.700
A hidden room!

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:24.170
Aki, go on ahead.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:28.120
I have to exterminate a rat.

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:35.150
Oh my!  After hearing Misty's story, 
I made a list of missing persons.

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:39.150
Everyone in this file is missing!

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:41.890
Arcadia Movement is actually…

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.030
Director Godwin!

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:52.220
No way!  Director Godwin is…

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:54.000
What are you doing?

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:55.470
Divine!

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:56.970
Just like I thought.

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.940
A rat sneaked in.

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:03.880
I thought you were working 
under Godwin's orders, but

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:06.880
by the surprised look on your 
face, I must be mistaken.

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:11.140
However, I can't let you leave 
after what you saw here.

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:17.220
Though you're a thieving rat, simply 
eliminating you would be too boring.

00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:22.240
I'll give you a small amount of hope.

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:23.270
By dueling?

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:25.590
I'll give you one turn.

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:29.600
What will you do?  Will you 
give up this small bit of hope?

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:32.910
In that case, I know I can do it!

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:36.680
Since that day, I studied dueling a lot!

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:41.650
Because my dream is to 
stop being a reporter...

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:47.580
And become married duelists with Jack!

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:51.490
I accept!

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:54.090
So you decided to fight.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.480
Duel!

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:57.960
My turn!

00:17:57.960 --> 00:18:00.820
I summon Telekinetic Shocker.

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:05.900
The first player can't 
attack on the first turn.

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:07.870
I end my turn.

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:10.130
Now it's your turn.

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:13.340
Entertain me with your one remaining turn.

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:17.570
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:21.690
By drawing this card, I'm in super trouble!

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:23.970
This is the worst fortune ever!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:29.170
If the rumors about psychic duelists are 
true, they deal real damage in battle.

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:33.200
Even though my fortune says I have 
bad luck, I have to keep fighting!

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:36.360
I summon Fortune Fairy Swee!

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:44.980
Then from my hand, I activate the 
Quick-Play Spell Unacceptable Result!

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:47.950
With this card, when I 
summon a Fortune Fairy, I

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.450
can summon a different 
Fortune Fairy from my hand!

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:53.550
Appear, Fortune Fairy Chee!

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:57.020
Then I activate a Spell Card from my hand!

00:18:57.020 --> 00:19:00.980
This card lets me Special 
Summon a Fortune Fairy from my

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:04.980
hand whose Level is one lower 
than a Fortune Fairy on my field!

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:07.900
Appear, Fortune Fairy Hu!

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:09.780
Zero attack points.

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:16.170
A woman with the brains of a mouse 
can't understand how nice I was.

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:20.610
Be quiet!  I'm going to make you cry!

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:25.270
The Continuous Spell Miracle Stone!

00:19:27.050 --> 00:19:34.060
With this card, my Fortune Fairies gain 1000 
attack points for every Fortune Fairy on the field!

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:38.800
However, they can't attack on the turn 
that they're summoned.  I end my turn!

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:43.030
I see.  Now I'm a little excited.

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:47.270
My turn.  I summon Psychic 
Snail from my hand!

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:53.010
Then my Quick-Play Spell Emergency Teleport!

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:58.720
With this card, I can Special Summon a Level 
3-or-below Psychic-Type monster from my hand or deck.

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:02.720
The monster I'm bringing 
out is Psychic Commander!

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:05.100
He has three monsters on his field.

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:08.950
However, all of them have fewer 
attack points than my monsters!

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:12.700
You think you have a solid 
defense, but you're wrong!

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:16.530
I activate Psychokinesis from my hand!

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:21.750
When I have a faceup 
Psychic-Type monster, I can

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:26.750
take 1000 points of damage to 
destroy a card on the field.

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:31.350
I destroy Miracle Stone, of course!

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:38.950
Now all of your monsters' 
attack points return to zero.

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:40.060
No way!

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:43.190
Go, Telekinetic Shocker!

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:53.200
Why did I feel an impact?

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:57.490
This is the power of a 
psychic duel.  Enjoy it.

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:59.300
Psychic Snail!

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:09.850
If you keep doing this, 
Security will investigate you.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:14.310
Don't worry.  You'll be treated 
as an accidental death.

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:17.350
The Public Maintenance 
Department can't touch us.

00:21:17.610 --> 00:21:21.060
As long as I know Godwin's secret.

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:23.560
Director Godwin's secret?

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:28.970
They say that he created Satellite, 
but that's a total lie.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:34.660
When Satellite was created, 
he was stuck inside.

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:39.080
He's actually from Satellite.

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:40.720
What?

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:42.540
Goodbye.

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:45.090
Go, Psychic Commander!

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:57.280
I see death.

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:59.170
No… way…

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:18.000
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:23.070
We will build our own future

00:22:23.540 --> 00:22:28.510
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:28.970 --> 00:22:33.680
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:39.280 --> 00:22:48.820
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:49.250 --> 00:22:54.390
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:54.460 --> 00:22:59.100
Even if it loses its light

00:22:59.570 --> 00:23:04.370
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:23:04.370 --> 00:23:08.840
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:23:09.040 --> 00:23:14.420
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:23:14.550 --> 00:23:19.230
This journey has no end

00:23:19.520 --> 00:23:24.760
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:25.190 --> 00:23:30.000
Hear my voice
